## Summary

✅ **DO:**
- Use Leaflet or Mapbox with Angular
- Clean up maps in `ngOnDestroy`
- Use Signals for reactive layer state
- Use `class` (not `className`)
- Lazy load map data
- Handle errors gracefully
- Use component classes for styling

❌ **DON'T:**
- Use React hooks (useEffect, useState, useRef)
- Forget to remove map on destroy
- Use `className`
- Load all data at once
- Skip error handling
- Use inline styles
